\f0\fs24 \cf0 Ornate Fantasy UI Asset Pack - README\
\
1. This is a general-use UI asset pack with a ton of different sprites and 9-slices\
- Mostly intended for Unity, there is a .unitypackage for easy use, but there's also the raw PNGs that can be used for anything, including other game engines\
- around 200 core assets, all with 8 color themes\
\
2. Contents\
- 8 sprite sheet PNGs (in SpriteSheets folder)\
- License file\
- Unity-specific version (.unitypackage)\
- pre-sized ui assets for non-unity users, includes all color varients.\
\
3. For Unity Users\
- After unzipping the download, you will get a .unitypackage\
- Go to Unity, right-click the assets field in the project bar\
- click import package -> custom package\
- Select your .unitypackage\
- Then it should open\
\
- the .unitypackage includes another README for further Unity instructions \
\
